abstract: "Reproducibility bundle for paper L (coverage of 95% intervals of extrapolated logical error rates, rotated surface code, d=3,5,7, with reference estimates by fault-stratified importance sampling, exact enumeration, and a certified d=9 interval): stim circuits and drivers, fitting recipes R1-R5, stored replicates, reference runs, pre-registration texts, the arXiv v7 source, and a stdlib-only recomputation of the headline coverage counts."
